 ],
 "cues": [
  {
   "t0": 0.16,
   "t1": 2.554,
   "text": "The shops I work with do great with word of mouth."
  },
  {
   "t0": 2.613334,
   "t1": 4.9653339999999995,
   "text": "There's a part of the business that people don't come in for."
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.0053339999999995,
   "t1": 7.941334,
   "text": "They get calls about services and prices and some people never"
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.981334,
   "t1": 11.471334,
   "text": "call because they found the answer somewhere else online first."
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.52,
   "t1": 14.221334,
   "text": "The shops I built got found by the people already looking for"
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.261334,
   "t1": 17.957334000000003,
   "text": "what they sell and it shows up in how many people walk in. This"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.997334000000002,
   "t1": 21.904,
   "text": "is how that happens. I got my first clients by walking in, pitching"
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.944,
   "t1": 25.584,
   "text": "cold. Some of them had spent years getting good at one thing and"
  },
  {
   "t0": 25.624,
   "t1": 28.437334000000003,
   "text": "never had a way to really show people searching for it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.477334000000003,
   "t1": 31.229334,
   "text": "I like the in-person part a lot, walking in and doing"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.269334,
   "t1": 32.479334,
   "text": "relationship with people."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.559999999999995,
   "t1": 36.04,
   "text": "The first part of what I build is photographs of everything"
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.08,
   "t1": 40.906,
   "text": "you sell, then the shop gets fully cataloged, a lot of places."
  },
  {
   "t0": 40.967999999999996,
   "t1": 43.936,
   "text": "Have maybe a rough catalog but it's good to be really thorough up"
  },
  {
   "t0": 43.976,
   "t1": 46.623999999999995,
   "text": "front because what we're going to do is move forward and have a"
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.663999999999994,
   "t1": 50.224,
   "text": "page on Google for every product in store, so that everyone"
  },
  {
   "t0": 50.263999999999996,
   "t1": 53.535999999999994,
   "text": "searching can find all those things for example a couple hundred"
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.57599999999999,
   "t1": 56.304,
   "text": "golf clubs. When someone searches for that, they normally get"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.344,
   "t1": 58.744,
   "text": "Dick's Sporting Goods because those guys already know how to"
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.784,
   "t1": 61.562,
   "text": "structure the data for that stuff to come up with consumers."
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.709334000000005,
   "t1": 66.421334,
   "text": "The clubs are showing up right alongside the big players in that"
  },
  {
   "t0": 66.46133400000001,
   "t1": 69.43199999999999,
   "text": "space. You'd be surprised how easy it is to match the online"
  },
  {
   "t0": 69.472,
   "t1": 70.752,
   "text": "presence of a big retailer."
  },
  {
   "t0": 70.792,
   "t1": 74.67999999999999,
   "text": "A catalog can take a week from the day we start or longer"
  },
  {
   "t0": 74.72,
   "t1": 77.69333400000001,
   "text": "depending on the size. Then there's another part that people"
  },
  {
   "t0": 77.73333400000001,
   "t1": 81.28266599999999,
   "text": "don't plan for. A site that nobody's looking after,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 81.322666,
   "t1": 83.79466599999999,
   "text": "your hours can change and someone drives in in your"
  },
  {
   "t0": 83.834666,
   "t1": 85.13866599999999,
   "text": "clothes and that hurts trust."
  },
  {
   "t0": 85.17866599999999,
   "t1": 88.658666,
   "text": "Service also can change over time and the page will stay the"
  },
  {
   "t0": 88.698666,
   "t1": 92.59466599999999,
   "text": "same. Then the monthly, you make everyday changes yourself in a back"
  },
  {
   "t0": 92.634666,
   "t1": 95.33866599999999,
   "text": "end built to make that easy for you and then stuff outside of"
  },
  {
   "t0": 95.378666,
   "t1": 99.41866599999999,
   "text": "that I'll get in quickly make a change for you when it's needed"
  },
  {
   "t0": 99.458666,
   "t1": 102.38666599999999,
   "text": "and I can even change the editor so that you can make those"
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.426666,
   "t1": 104.30666599999999,
   "text": "changes more easily going forward."
  },
  {
   "t0": 104.346666,
   "t1": 107.38666599999999,
   "text": "Hosting, upkeep and the changes are all in the monthly, plus looking at how"
  },
  {
   "t0": 107.426666,
   "t1": 108.43466599999999,
   "text": "your pages perform each month."
  },
  {
   "t0": 108.474666,
   "t1": 110.890666,
   "text": "It's not we get set up and it costs more than you want if you"
  },
  {
   "t0": 110.930666,
   "t1": 113.80266599999999,
   "text": "ever want changes. If you're signed up, we make it ideal for you"
  },
  {
   "t0": 113.842666,
   "t1": 116.94133199999999,
   "text": "going forward. Getting started is a few questions on the form,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 116.981332,
   "t1": 119.341332,
   "text": "then we talk about your business, photos you have, and the list"
  },
  {
   "t0": 119.381332,
   "t1": 123.29333199999999,
   "text": "of what you sell. If that's only in your head, that's okay."
  },
  {
   "t0": 123.333332,
   "t1": 126.17333199999999,
   "text": "I can walk through and photograph everything on the shelves and"
  },
  {
   "t0": 126.213332,
   "t1": 127.389332,
   "text": "get that all cataloged."
  },
  {
   "t0": 127.429332,
   "t1": 129.933332,
   "text": "If you already have a website, it'll stay up until we switch it"
  },
  {
   "t0": 129.973332,
   "t1": 132.119998,
   "text": "over. which is a lot easier than you'd think."
  },
  {
   "t0": 132.159998,
   "t1": 134.463998,
   "text": "This is for people who already know they need it and waiting for"
  },
  {
   "t0": 134.503998,
   "t1": 136.487998,
   "text": "somebody that they can trust and a process that's"
  },
  {
   "t0": 136.527998,
   "t1": 140.087998,
   "text": "straightforward. If you want flexibility down the road, you want"
  },
  {
   "t0": 140.127998,
   "t1": 143.159998,
   "text": "to grow, you want to be able to change the answers on your site"
  },
  {
   "t0": 143.199998,
   "t1": 145.34666400000003,
   "text": "because they will change over time."
  },
  {
   "t0": 145.38666400000002,
   "t1": 146.26666400000002,
   "text": "It's not for everybody."
  },
  {
   "t0": 146.306664,
   "t1": 148.59466400000002,
   "text": "If your site loads fast and says the right things and people are"
  },
  {
   "t0": 148.63466400000001,
   "t1": 151.08266400000002,
   "text": "finding you, keep it. I can tell you straightforwardly if you"
  },
  {
   "t0": 151.12266400000001,
   "t1": 153.66399800000002,
   "text": "need this or not. How much time is this going to take though?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 153.703998,
   "t1": 155.215998,
   "text": "It kind of depends on the person."
  },
  {
   "t0": 155.255998,
   "t1": 158.023998,
   "text": "Some people have more time to put towards it and that's great for"
  },
  {
   "t0": 158.063998,
   "t1": 160.911998,
   "text": "improving performance but other people are really busy already"
  },
  {
   "t0": 160.951998,
   "t1": 162.31999800000003,
   "text": "doing what they do best."
  },
  {
   "t0": 162.35999800000002,
   "t1": 166.29599800000003,
   "text": "So it comes down to the owner specifically, but it could be just"
  },
  {
   "t0": 166.33599800000002,
   "t1": 169.215998,
   "text": "the time we set up it upfront and then your small changes going"
  },
  {
   "t0": 169.255998,
   "t1": 172.02599800000002,
   "text": "forward. You just log on and do that in like 30 seconds."
  },
  {
   "t0": 173.05599800000002,
   "t1": 174.393998,
   "text": "Or other people might put"
  },
  {
   "t0": 174.559998,
   "t1": 177.191998,
   "text": "More time like a couple hours a week say if they started doing"
  },
  {
   "t0": 177.231998,
   "t1": 182.085332,
   "text": "shipping online. For most of the shops I work with, I am local."
  },
  {
   "t0": 182.125332,
   "t1": 184.597332,
   "text": "I'd rather walk in and get to know you and the place."
  },
  {
   "t0": 184.637332,
   "t1": 188.413332,
   "text": "And if you're not from Erie, calls and screen shares do the job."
  },
  {
   "t0": 188.453332,
   "t1": 190.207998,
   "text": "I just can't take the photos myself."
  },
  {
   "t0": 190.247998,
   "t1": 192.35999800000002,
   "text": "You need to know the person you're working with has time for you"
  },
  {
   "t0": 192.399998,
   "t1": 193.47999800000002,
   "text": "and it isn't going to screw you over."
  },
  {
   "t0": 193.51999800000002,
   "t1": 196.00799800000001,
   "text": "So you own the site. If you ever want to take it somewhere"
  },
  {
   "t0": 196.047998,
   "t1": 197.159998,
   "text": "else, it goes with you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 197.199998,
   "t1": 199.399998,
   "text": "There's no price hidden from you until the last minute."
  },
  {
   "t0": 199.439998,
   "t1": 202.135998,
   "text": "Anything bigger than the monthly, I'll quote before I start."
  },
  {
   "t0": 202.175998,
   "t1": 205.655998,
   "text": "And if you're not happy, 90 days, no questions asked, full"
  },
  {
   "t0": 205.695998,
   "t1": 207.56199800000002,
   "text": "refund. You get all your money back."
  },
  {
   "t0": 207.63466400000001,
   "t1": 209.316664,
   "text": "That's the Stray Success Guarantee."
  },
  {
   "t0": 209.47466400000002,
   "t1": 211.698664,
   "text": "What's worse, not giving it a chance or giving it a chance and"
  },
  {
   "t0": 211.738664,
   "t1": 214.50933,
   "text": "having 90 days to see if it succeeds for you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 214.54933,
   "t1": 216.76533,
   "text": "The owners I've worked with are all happy."
  },
  {
   "t0": 216.80533,
   "t1": 220.34933,
   "text": "I paid attention to details and went beyond what I said at the"
  },
  {
   "t0": 220.38933,
   "t1": 222.50332999999998,
   "text": "start. One of"
  },
  {
   "t0": 223.86132999999998,
   "t1": 226.735996,
   "text": "them, a restaurant owner here in Erie, said: The communication"
  },
  {
   "t0": 226.775996,
   "t1": 228.407996,
   "text": "and timeliness of his work is outstanding."
  },
  {
   "t0": 228.447996,
   "t1": 230.455996,
   "text": "I could not be happier with the product also."
  },
  {
   "t0": 230.495996,
   "t1": 232.985996,
   "text": "His web design was awesome."
  },
  {
   "t0": 233.02666200000002,
   "t1": 234.756662,
   "text": "He listens, then executes."
  },
  {
   "t0": 234.813328,
   "t1": 237.05332800000002,
   "text": "You've spent years getting good at one thing and never had a way"
  },
  {
   "t0": 237.093328,
   "t1": 238.74932800000002,
   "text": "to show it to people already searching for it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 238.789328,
   "t1": 241.087328,
   "text": "Word of mouth carries that part that's doing great."
  },
  {
   "t0": 241.130662,
   "t1": 242.67999600000002,
   "text": "The rest are finding it somewhere else."
  },
  {
   "t0": 242.719996,
   "t1": 245.23999600000002,
   "text": "If you want them finding your shop, call my number."
  },
  {
   "t0": 245.279996,
   "t1": 247.743996,
   "text": "I'm early on and looking to onboard more clients."
  },
  {
   "t0": 247.783996,
   "t1": 250.10133000000002,
   "text": "Or if you're on the site, fill out the form."
  },
  {
   "t0": 250.14133,
   "t1": 252.62333,
   "text": "Start with just answering a few questions."
  }
 ],
